WEBVTT

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:14.120
I'll tell you one thing.

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:18.250
I was only acting like that before
to see what you would do!

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.830
I love you either way, Kirara!

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:25.200
Yuuna, you know that wasn't the real me!

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.950
Really? You were cute
like you used to be, though.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.370
You should just be honest
about your feelings, already.

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:43.790
Let's stretch, Kirara!

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:45.410
O-Okay!

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:23.370
Super HXEROS!

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:26.580
Episode 8: H-energy Monster!

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.290
I'm going on ahead, Kirara.

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:39.410
C-Cool.

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:45.790
You won't please the boys by buttoning
your shirt all the way to the top.

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:51.120
Just recently,
I've started to hallucinate.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:55.580
You look like a silkworm moth...

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:58.080
...but you're much more annoying!

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:03.250
--I don't know if that's
what brought on the hallucinations...

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:05.870
--What is this?
--I don't know if that's
what brought on the hallucinations...

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:07.910
...but they manifest as...

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:13.040
There you are again, Dark Kirara.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.540
You finally addressed me.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:25.120
I don't know why, but a younger version of me
that at first only appeared in my dreams

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:29.080
has recently been putting her two cents in
as a waking-life hallucination.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:34.580
But the name "Dark Kirara" sounds like
a mineral to me, so it's not cute at all!

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:37.950
Can you call me anything cuter?

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:41.120
You're a version of me from my dark past,
so it's "Dark Kirara."

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.290
It fits you perfectly.

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:48.950
That aside, what's with your outfit?

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:53.080
Oh, this? I guess the style is like
"an imp who instigates evil deeds"?

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:55.580
Well, it's embarrassing for me to look at!

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:56.950
That may be,

00:03:56.950 --> 00:04:01.160
but I'm a manifestation of
the unconscious mind that you always repress.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:08.080
I suppose this appearance
is indicative of your secret interests.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:11.830
I'm done talking with you!

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.540
--Hey, wait! Hey!

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:14.620
--What's wrong?
--Hey, wait! Hey!

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:18.120
Just leave me alone!

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:23.080
Wh-Whatever I did, I'm sorry!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.450
Enjo?

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.830
That's what I was trying to tell you!

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:30.950
It makes sense.
I know you're under a lot of stress.

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:33.870
Wait! Forget what I just said!

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:37.370
You've got to show him your sincerity!

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:45.580
A-Are you okay, Hoshino?

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:48.540
Y-Yeah.

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:51.120
What's the matter?
You're acting kind of weird.

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:54.120
I-It's nothing, really.

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:58.620
Boring! You were supposed
to have a more thrilling fall!

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:01.950
Do you want me
to give you a good example?

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:07.000
Stop it!

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.500
Stop what?

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.910
What are you doing to me? Darn it!

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:22.120
I haven't done anything.

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:26.250
A simple hallucination
couldn't actually touch you, right?

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:29.750
You may think that I pushed you,

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:33.160
but you actually made yourself
collapse into Ret's arms.

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:39.450
In fact, maybe you unconsciously caused
all of the erotic happenings up to now!

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:42.330
Th-That's ridiculous!

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:44.620
--What are you talking about?
You little cherub devil!

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:48.370
--Kirara is really under a lot of stress.
--What are you talking about?
You little cherub devil!

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:52.290
What was bugging Hoshino?

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.410
You! From Tokyo Branch.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.450
I finally found you, Retto Enjo.

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:06.370
Can I have a minute of your time?

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.200
So, what do you want?

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:12.080
If it's about Chacha, she isn't here.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:16.370
Um, I wanted to apologize
for kicking you last time.

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:19.330
Oh, that was nothing.

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:24.660
Also, um, is that blondie your girlfriend?

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:26.410
Blondie?

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:30.080
She was with you last time, wasn't she?
A member of Saitama Branch...

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:32.330
Y-You mean Hoshino?

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:35.620
She's not my girlfriend, though.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:42.950
What, did she reject you?
You scared me for a second there!

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:44.750
I'll cheer you up!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.160
Wanna see my panties?

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:49.040
I don't need anything like that!

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:52.620
Anyway, this is perfect then.

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:54.700
Let's become H-friends!

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:56.290
H-friends?

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:59.120
You don't call it that in Saitama?

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:04.330
H-friends are friends
who help each other accumulate H-energy.

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:07.540
Here. I added my contact info.

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:10.660
How did you get my phone?

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:11.950
Later!

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:16.160
In the end,
I got a flash of her panties.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.660
It's Shiko!
Sorry for taking up your time today.

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:26.660
Can I contact you again
when I have some free time?

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:28.620
All of a sudden, she's polite.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:41.750
Is that the girl from Tokyo Branch?

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:53.290
I bought this today.
Does it look good on me?

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:55.950
Did I take a cute photo?

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:59.700
But maybe that's
not stimulating enough for him.

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:02.580
Something that would make him
feel more H-energy.

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:13.040
"SEND THIS PHOTO?
CANCEL/OK"

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:15.910
A-As if...

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:18.410
Shiko!

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:21.160
Dinner's ready, so get to the table!

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:23.660
I-I'll be right there!

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.250
W-Wait a second!

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:32.200
"READ"

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.790
Your account has been hijacked by spam.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.080
Huh? He's got some nerve.

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:58.160
H-Hey, man.

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:01.160
G-Good morning, Murasame.

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:05.160
Here. It has a lot of ingredients
that'll build your energy.

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:07.790
Good luck with
your Kiseichuu exterminating, too.

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:10.160
Th-Thanks.

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:13.080
What are you blushing about
after everything that's happened?

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.790
We've done more embarrassing things
to each other, haven't we?

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:17.910
H-Hey!

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:22.700
Enjo is a member of our team, so I'd
ask you not to recruit him or whatever!

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:27.700
What? It's not like
you're his girlfriend, right?

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:30.330
And from the strait-laced way
you're dressed,

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:32.700
I bet you're not even his H-friend.

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:34.370
H-friend?

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:40.250
Sorry, but he's the only one
I can feel H-energy with.

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:42.580
What does that mean?

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:45.080
Later, you two.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:03.500
Delicious.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:09.620
A rival has appeared
from an unexpected quarter, huh?

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:12.750
"THE COOKING WIFE"

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.160
"THE COOKING WIFE"
That looks like an interesting magazine.

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:16.290
"THE COOKING WIFE"
Shut up.

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:20.580
But you're living together,
so you have the advantage.

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:22.370
And you have an ace up your sleeve, too.

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:24.200
An ace?

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:27.080
You should ravish him. Use force.

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:28.250
Wha?!

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:33.750
Oh, Ret, without this,
you're powerless, huh?

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:37.950
How does it feel to succumb
to a girl's strength?

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.870
Come on. You can do this!

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:47.870
If you don't resist more,
I'm going to eat you up, Ret.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:53.410
I-I can't even imagine it!

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:55.580
When you were doing just that!

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:59.500
And right now, Ret is taking a bath.

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:03.450
Not eating the meal set before her
is a woman's shame.

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:09.080
You don't care if a perfect stranger
takes Ret away from you?

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:11.910
Fine.

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:14.660
But there's no way I can force him!

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:19.370
My limit is walking in and pretending
that I thought no one else was there.

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:24.250
I guess I'll take a leisurely bath.

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:27.790
Don't struggle!
Just let me put it in my mouth!

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:31.580
The deal was just once!

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.160
--H-Hey! What are you--
--Excuse me!

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:39.200
Wh-What are you two doing?

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:41.290
G-Get away, Kirara!

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:08.040
Enough!

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:11.540
No means no!

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:17.120
Hey, did you just hear something?

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:22.450
Not sure, but I'm guessing it was Kirara
punching Ret after peeking into the bath.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:23.830
The usual.

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:25.580
We don't need to worry?

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:28.500
I just lost respect for you, Enjo!

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:30.330
I-It's not what you think, Kirara!

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:33.290
That wasn't Retto's fault.

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:36.200
Beast Mode?

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:37.120
Yeah.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:41.290
I don't have all the details myself,
but when Chacha bites me,

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:45.120
I lose all reason
and turn into some sex-crazed savage.

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:49.410
I guess that's what happened with
that girl from Tokyo Branch before.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:53.290
Now she thinks I'm the right person
to supply her with H-energy,

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:55.540
but it's a little embarrassing.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:59.620
So that's what happened with her.

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:01.660
So I apologize for before!

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:05.330
I don't remember what I did,
but I take it that it was something weird!

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:10.700
Honestly, it was my fault
for walking in on him.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:11.830
Forbidden!

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:19.410
This Beast Mode is too dangerous
if it makes you lose all sense of reason.

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:21.120
R-Right!

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:24.040
That's what I told you, Chacha!

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:28.790
Sorry. I just wanted to draw out
more powerful H-energy.

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:30.910
What a waste!

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:34.410
Well, I guess it's boring to be ravished
by a Ret who's lost his senses.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:35.540
Yeah, yeah.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:37.330
Did you say something?

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.910
N-No!

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:41.410
There, Chacha. You're dry now.

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:50.040
Eek!

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:53.080
H-energy Drink.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:56.000
Give the beast inside you
an erotic boost.

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:00.830
Do you want power?

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.370
Who are you?

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:06.450
Well? Do you want power?

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:08.410
Well, I guess.

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:13.410
If you want power,
obey your physiological response.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:14.660
Is that all?

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:16.450
H-Hold on!

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:17.790
Wait!

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:23.000
What's wrong, Retto?

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:26.950
Your tossing and turning in bed
was rougher than usual.

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:30.450
Don't come crawling into my bed,
or people will get the wrong idea!

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:35.160
What is this?
"H-energy Drink"?

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:38.000
Crap, I'm running late!
Is there anything to eat?

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:39.410
Can I take this?

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:41.080
S-Sure.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:48.700
Good morning.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.330
You seem to be in a good mood.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:55.660
Actually, headquarters
has sent us a free sample.

00:14:55.660 --> 00:15:02.040
It's called an H-energy Drink, and
supposedly it replenishes your H-energy.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.000
What? It's gone!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.080
Retto just took it with him.

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:07.290
What the hell?!

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.870
I'm thirsty.

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:16.450
Want one?

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:20.830
Murasame?

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:24.120
Thank you.
I've been seeing you here a lot lately.

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:28.160
I-I just happened to swing by
after a Kiseichuu extermination!

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:31.080
Is it possible you don't have any friends?

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:33.950
I-I have friends, at least!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.700
First, there are the three members
of the Tokyo Branch.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.620
And then, um...

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:39.830
I shouldn't have asked.

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:41.790
Shut up! I have more than that!

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:45.040
I have one H-friend here.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:47.700
Wh-What are you blushing about?

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:54.660
What is this juice? It tastes weird.

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:57.410
That's what you say
after swiping someone's drink?

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:58.950
You try it, too.

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:00.500
N-No, you can finish it!

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:02.410
Just have some!

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:04.580
That would be an indirect kiss, right?

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:08.000
What are you two sneaking around about?

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:10.330
H-Hoshino!

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:12.250
Just when we
were getting to the good part.

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:16.040
We were only talking about
whether this juice tasted funny.

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:20.120
That's what you say, but I bet you were
actually trying to do something lewd.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.370
I'm serious.

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:24.540
If you don't believe me, have a swig.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.290
Fine, whatever.

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:31.700
What? It's good.

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:34.290
R-Really? Good.

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:46.080
By the way, I heard
you just joined HXEROS recently?

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:51.250
As a veteran, I could teach you
a few tricks about H-energy.

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:55.540
Not interested.

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:59.330
I don't need your help
to be better than you.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:03.370
Interesting. Care to put your money
where your mouth is?

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:05.120
I hoped you would say that.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:08.620
What the heck? They're both acting weird.

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:10.120
Don't tell me.

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:12.120
It's because of this?

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:15.790
"KARAOKE MASTER"

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:19.500
Thank goodness.
They meant a karaoke showdown.

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:27.750
This sofa is so soft.
It's like the most comfortable couch ever!

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:32.250
Is it hot in here, or is it just me?

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:36.410
I-I'm gonna get something to drink.
Do you want something?

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:37.750
I'll have a cola!

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:40.750
I'll have an iced tea, strong!

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:44.580
So what's the name of the game?

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:48.580
Hard to believe you would really call
for a karaoke showdown.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:52.040
You saw right through that, huh?

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:56.500
Since we're HXEROS,
the decider is H-energy.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:00.790
With this, we'll be able to tell how much
H-energy has been accumulated.

00:18:00.790 --> 00:18:06.080
Whoever makes Retto collect the most
H-energy is the winner. How about that?

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:09.250
Sure. You're on!

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:11.790
Do it, old me!

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:16.500
Here are the drinks.

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.290
Are you surprised?

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:25.500
These days, cosplay is being used
to enhance karaoke.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.370
Y-Yeah, I've heard.

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:39.250
But enough with the karaoke.

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:42.580
Since this is a private room,
let's do something more fun!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:44.700
B-But there's a song I wanna sing.

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:49.580
What? You're more interested
in karaoke than me?

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:51.250
I-I didn't say that.

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:54.910
All right! Then let's sing together!

00:18:55.370 --> 00:19:00.330
"ECONOMICAL OBSERVATION"

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:03.620
Come in a little closer!

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.410
O-Our faces are too close already.

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:09.620
That's fine! Too far apart,
and you won't accumulate any H-energy.

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:12.080
I don't care about that right now.

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:17.580
--One, two...
--Go!

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:34.410
Hey, Enjo,
why don't you try using this mic?

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:38.410
Hoshino!

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:49.450
Go on. Sing.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.750
As if I could sing like this?!

00:19:55.950 --> 00:20:00.540
To accumulate more H-energy, should I
have put something else between my legs?

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:03.200
Hey, that was my idea!

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:10.620
I-Is this...

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:13.910
...the effect of the H-energy Drink?

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:23.290
I refuse...

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:25.330
...to lose!

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:45.790
"UNMEASURABLE"

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.200
What was I just doing?

00:20:54.660 --> 00:20:56.660
My head hurts.

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:59.040
This outfit...

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:01.910
Are you responsible for this?

00:21:01.910 --> 00:21:04.870
Don't ask me.

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:09.040
She's a tough rival.

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:16.160
What a terrible experience.

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:23.500
You knew what was going on, didn't you?

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:28.330
How could I?
I just draw from your knowledge,

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:32.080
so I have no way of knowing
what you don't know.

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:33.500
True.

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:36.870
Besides, it's not like I'm your enemy.

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:38.500
So let's get along.

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:40.330
Forget it!

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:49.370
Why have you suddenly appeared
in the first place?

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:53.790
When I sealed her away
in the recesses of my mind that day...

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:56.040
Why, you ask?

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.370
I guess you've forgotten.

00:22:00.200 --> 00:22:02.950
The promise you made that day.

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:05.080
Promise?

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:10.250
My purpose is to get me and Ret together.

00:23:47.620 --> 00:23:49.410
Super HXEROS!

00:23:49.410 --> 00:23:51.790
Next time: Hadakana Beach Season Opening!
